# ============================================================
# CareHub — committed PUBLIC config for CI builds
# ============================================================
# This file is SAFE to commit: the Supabase anon key is public
# by design (it ships inside every client bundle). Data is
# protected by Row Level Security (RLS) policies, never by this
# key. The service_role key must NEVER go here.
#
# The GitHub Actions workflow (deploy.yml) uses this file when
# the repo secrets VITE_SUPABASE_URL / VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY
# are not set. If those secrets exist, they take precedence.
#
# To point the app at a different Supabase project, update this
# file (and the local .env) together.

